<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to December 11 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat    593.3  5,720.0   Dec-Nov	4,761.2  3,226.6</p>
<p> Maize	  6,663.7  2,000.0   Mar-Feb	6,608.4    604.9</p>
<p> Sorghum	  667.1    670.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     16.5</p>
<p> Soybeans     2,011.8  2,050.0   Apr-Mar	2,143.7    606.7</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 537.2    600.0   Jan-Dec	  582.0     14.3</p>
